<title>JAPAN: RESEARCH ALERT - Kokuyo raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Kokuyo raised.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Daiwa Institute of Research</p>
<p>Ltd upgraded Kokuyo Co Ltd to a &quot;A&quot; from its previous</p>
<p>&quot;B&quot;, Daiwa Securities brokers said on Thursday.</p>
<p>In its three-grade rating system, the research institute</p>
<p>assigns an &quot;A&quot; rating to issues whose values it</p>
<p>sees outperforming the Tokyo Stock Exchange first-section</p>
<p>TOPIX index by more than 10 percentage points over the</p>
<p>next six months.</p>
</text>
